  "daily_overview": "科技领域，OpenAI 宣布其 AI 模型成功攻克「千年数学难题」，引领 AI Agent 进入自主递归改进的新阶段，与此同时，苹果发布首款折叠屏手机，标志着硬件形态的重大跨越。财经层面，全球债券市场遭遇抛售，中美十年期国债收益率息差达到历史极值，加之通胀阴影重现，市场波动加剧，投资者寻求资产避险与多元化配置。时政方面，美伊紧张局势持续升级，不仅触发油价突破百元关口，也成为左右美国中期选举的关键变量，全球地缘政治与经济的联动效应日益显著。\n\nIn technology, OpenAI has announced that its models have solved a \"Millennium Prize Problem,\" signaling a new phase of autonomous recursive self-improvement for AI Agents, while Apple's launch of its first foldable iPhone marks a significant shift in hardware design. In finance, the global bond market faces a sell-off as the yield gap between US and Chinese 10-year sovereign bonds hits a record high, compounded by resurgent inflation fears. Politically, the escalating US-Iran conflict has pushed oil prices above $100 and become a pivotal factor in the upcoming US midterm elections, underscoring the deepening link between global geopolitics and the economy.",
